    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to present 87 Bru Na Habhainn, Navan to the market for sale. This well-presented two/three bedroom mid-terraced family home is situated on a quiet cul de sac overlooking a large green area and is located in this popular and mature estate, close to Navan town centre.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises of an entrance hall, living room to the front, guest wc, and an open plan kitchen/dining room to the rear of the ground floor.\r\nOn the first floor are two large double bedrooms, main bathroom and storage closet. The property contains a converted attic which includes a bathroom and a separate space that is currently being used as a bedroom but is suitable for a variety of different uses.\r\n\r\nBru Na Habhainn is a well-regarded housing estate and the home has been very well maintained by its owners over the past number of years. a highly convenient location on the outskirts of Navan, offering easy access to the town centre and an excellent range of local amenities. The immediate area provides a wide selection of shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, leisure facilities and sporting clubs, together with primary and secondary schools."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
